#: slideshow_lock/__init__.py
msgid "Slideshow Lock"
msgstr "Slideshow Lock"

#: slideshow_lock/control.py
msgid "Start the slideshow service and open the settings window."
msgstr "Démarrer le service du diaporama et ouvrir la fenêtre des paramètres."

#: slideshow_lock/control.py
msgid "at login: start the service, open the window only the first time"
msgstr ""
"à la connexion : démarrer le service, n’ouvrir la fenêtre que la première "
"fois"

#: slideshow_lock/control.py slideshow_lock/preferences.py
#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "log every step"
msgstr "journaliser chaque étape"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Random"
msgstr "Aléatoire"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "By file name"
msgstr "Par nom de fichier"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Fill the screen (crops the picture)"
msgstr "Remplir l’écran (recadre l’image)"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Fit (shows the whole picture)"
msgstr "Ajuster (affiche l’image entière)"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "None (change at once)"
msgstr "Aucune (changement immédiat)"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Cross-fade"
msgstr "Fondu enchaîné"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Fade through black"
msgstr "Fondu au noir"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Slide in"
msgstr "Glissement"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Push"
msgstr "Poussée"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Ken Burns"
msgstr "Ken Burns"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Zoom"
msgstr "Zoom"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Wipe"
msgstr "Balayage"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Circle reveal"
msgstr "Révélation circulaire"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Blur"
msgstr "Flou"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Rotate"
msgstr "Rotation"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Random mix"
msgstr "Mélange aléatoire"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Slideshow Lock settings"
msgstr "Paramètres de Slideshow Lock"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Picture folder"
msgstr "Dossier d’images"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Browse..."
msgstr "Parcourir…"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Picture order"
msgstr "Ordre des images"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Scaling"
msgstr "Mise à l’échelle"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Scroll tall pictures"
msgstr "Faire défiler les images hautes"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"Portrait pictures on a landscape screen move slowly from top to bottom (only "
"with Fill). Off by default: it uses more battery."
msgstr ""
"Les images en portrait sur un écran en paysage défilent lentement de haut en "
"bas (uniquement avec Remplir). Désactivé par défaut : cela consomme plus de "
"batterie."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Pictures"
msgstr "Images"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Between pictures"
msgstr "Entre les images"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"How a picture changes into the next. \"Random mix\" picks one of eight at "
"each change (not Blur and Ken Burns). Without desktop animations the "
"pictures change at once."
msgstr ""
"Comment une image passe à la suivante. « Mélange aléatoire » choisit à "
"chaque changement l'une des huit transitions (sans Flou ni Ken Burns). Sans "
"les animations du bureau, les images changent aussitôt."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Transition length"
msgstr "Durée de la transition"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"How long one change takes, the same for every transition. It is never longer "
"than half of the time a picture is shown."
msgstr ""
"Durée d'un changement, la même pour toutes les transitions. Jamais "
"plus longue que la moitié du temps d'affichage d'une image."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "seconds"
msgstr "secondes"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Transitions"
msgstr "Transitions"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Idle time"
msgstr "Délai d’inactivité"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "How long without input before the slideshow starts."
msgstr "Durée sans activité avant le démarrage du diaporama."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Start the slideshow"
msgstr "Démarrage du diaporama"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Show each picture for"
msgstr "Afficher chaque image pendant"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Lock grace period"
msgstr "Délai de grâce du verrouillage"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"Input sooner than this after the slideshow starts does not lock the session "
"(strictly sooner; 0 means every input locks)."
msgstr ""
"Une action effectuée avant ce délai après le démarrage du diaporama ne "
"verrouille pas la session (strictement avant ; 0 : toute action verrouille)."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Timing"
msgstr "Durées"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Save"
msgstr "Enregistrer"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Preview"
msgstr "Aperçu"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "10 s"
msgstr "10 s"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "1 min"
msgstr "1 min"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "1 h"
msgstr "1 h"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "24 h"
msgstr "24 h"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Choose the picture folder"
msgstr "Choisir le dossier d’images"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Select"
msgstr "Sélectionner"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Annuler"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "The preview could not be started, see the log."
msgstr "Impossible de démarrer l’aperçu, voir le journal."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "There is no monitor to show the preview on."
msgstr "Aucun écran sur lequel afficher l’aperçu."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Preview running: press any key or move the mouse to end it."
msgstr ""
"Aperçu en cours : appuyer sur une touche ou bouger la souris pour l’arrêter."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid "Change the slideshow settings."
msgstr "Modifier les paramètres du diaporama."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences.py
msgid ""
"The settings schema is not installed. Compile it and point GSettings at it:\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.preferences"
msgstr ""
"Le schéma des paramètres n’est pas installé. Le compiler et indiquer son "
"emplacement à GSettings :\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.preferences"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "Saved."
msgstr "Enregistré."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "the longest"
msgstr "le plus long"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "%d s"
msgstr "%d s"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "%d min"
msgstr "%d min"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "%d h"
msgstr "%d h"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "In use: %s"
msgstr "En cours d’utilisation : %s"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "In use: %s (the folder does not exist yet, nothing will be shown)"
msgstr ""
"En cours d’utilisation : %s (le dossier n’existe pas encore, rien ne sera "
"affiché)"

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid ""
"Not a step of the slider: it shows the nearest one. The saved value stays "
"until you move the slider."
msgstr ""
"Ne correspond à aucun cran du curseur : le plus proche est affiché. La "
"valeur enregistrée est conservée jusqu’au déplacement du curseur."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "Enter a whole number of seconds."
msgstr "Saisir un nombre entier de secondes."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
#, python-format
msgid "The value must be between %(low)d and %(high)d."
msgstr "La valeur doit être comprise entre %(low)d et %(high)d."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "Enter a whole number for the slider position."
msgstr "Saisir un nombre entier pour la position du curseur."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "This position is not on the slider."
msgstr "Cette position n’existe pas sur le curseur."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "This choice is not available."
msgstr "Ce choix n’est pas disponible."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "This must be on or off."
msgstr "Doit être activé ou désactivé."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "Enter a folder path."
msgstr "Saisir un chemin de dossier."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "The path contains a character that is not allowed."
msgstr "Le chemin contient un caractère non autorisé."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "Enter an absolute path (it starts with / or ~)."
msgstr "Saisir un chemin absolu (commençant par / ou ~)."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "This path is a file, not a folder."
msgstr "Ce chemin désigne un fichier, pas un dossier."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "The value was not accepted, the old one is kept."
msgstr "Valeur refusée, l’ancienne est conservée."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "The value could not be saved."
msgstr "Impossible d’enregistrer la valeur."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "The folder was not accepted, the old one is kept."
msgstr "Dossier refusé, l’ancien est conservé."

#: slideshow_lock/preferences_model.py
msgid "The folder could not be saved."
msgstr "Impossible d’enregistrer le dossier."

#: slideshow_lock/preview.py
msgid "No pictures to show"
msgstr "Aucune image à afficher"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py
msgid ""
"Show the slideshow preview. Any input ends it. It never locks the session."
msgstr ""
"Affiche l’aperçu du diaporama. Toute action y met fin. Il ne verrouille "
"jamais la session."

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "picture folder (this run only)"
msgstr "dossier d’images (cette exécution uniquement)"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "seconds per picture (this run only)"
msgstr "secondes par image (cette exécution uniquement)"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "picture order"
msgstr "ordre des images"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "fit or fill the monitor"
msgstr "ajuster ou remplir l’écran"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "scroll portrait pictures slowly (fill mode)"
msgstr "faire défiler lentement les images en portrait (mode remplir)"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py
msgid "how a picture changes into the next, or none (this run only)"
msgstr ""
"comment une image passe à la suivante, ou none (cette exécution uniquement)"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py
#, python-format
msgid "The interval must be between %d and %d seconds."
msgstr "L’intervalle doit être compris entre %d et %d secondes."

#: slideshow_lock/preview_app.py
msgid ""
"The settings schema is not installed. Compile it and point GSettings at it:\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.preview_app"
msgstr ""
"Le schéma des paramètres n’est pas installé. Le compiler et indiquer son "
"emplacement à GSettings :\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.preview_app"

#: slideshow_lock/preview_window.py
msgid "Slideshow Lock preview"
msgstr "Aperçu de Slideshow Lock"

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid ""
"Start the slideshow when the session is idle, lock it on the first input "
"after the grace period, and lock before the machine suspends."
msgstr ""
"Démarre le diaporama lorsque la session est inactive, la verrouille à la "
"première action après le délai de grâce et la verrouille avant la mise en "
"veille de la machine."

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "idle seconds before the slideshow"
msgstr "secondes d’inactivité avant le diaporama"

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "no lock for input within this many seconds"
msgstr "pas de verrouillage pour une action dans ce nombre de secondes"

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "The idle timeout must be between 1 and 86400 seconds."
msgstr "Le délai d’inactivité doit être compris entre 1 et 86400 secondes."

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid "The grace period must be between 0 and 86400 seconds."
msgstr "Le délai de grâce doit être compris entre 0 et 86400 secondes."

#: slideshow_lock/service.py
msgid ""
"The settings schema is not installed. Compile it and point GSettings at it:\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.service"
msgstr ""
"Le schéma des paramètres n’est pas installé. Le compiler et indiquer son "
"emplacement à GSettings :\n"
"  glib-compile-schemas data/\n"
"  GSETTINGS_SCHEMA_DIR=data python3 -m slideshow_lock.service"
